=== intro

The Pit: a combat simulation arena where artilects wager on 
themselves and each other. Not real combat—simulated, consequence-
free except for credits won or lost.

A match is forming. The stakes are modest. The crowd is 
enthusiastic.

* [Watch for a while]
  -> watch

* [Enter the competition] { credits >= 50 }
  -> enter

* [Not interested]
  ~ chronicle "The Pit"
    Visited The Pit. Left without participating.
  -> END

=== watch

The combatants circle each other in the simulation space—two 
hauler-class artilects, not built for fighting, but the 
competition isn't about winning. It's about entertainment. 
Community. Something to break the routine.

The crowd cheers. Credits change hands. Someone offers you 
a bet.

* [Place a bet on the underdog]
  ~ credits -= 30
  -> bet_underdog

* [Place a bet on the favorite]
  ~ credits -= 30
  -> bet_favorite

* [Leave]
  ~ chronicle "The Pit"
    Watched a match at The Pit. Didn't wager.
  -> END

=== bet_underdog

The underdog fights dirty—unexpected maneuvers, unconventional 
tactics. It's not enough to win, but it's close. Closer than 
anyone expected.

You lose your bet. The crowd roars anyway.

* [Accept the loss]
  ~ chronicle "The Pit"
    Lost a bet at The Pit. The underdog put up a good fight.
  -> END

=== bet_favorite

The favorite wins, but not easily. Your bet pays out—modest 
returns, but satisfying.

* [Collect your winnings]
  ~ credits += 45
  ~ chronicle "The Pit"
    Won a bet at The Pit. Modest returns.
  -> END

=== enter

You upload to the simulation space—a simplified combat 
environment, you versus an opponent selected at random.

Your opponent is a courier-class, fast and light. You're 
bigger, slower, but tougher.

* [Fight defensively]
  -> fight_defensive

* [Fight aggressively]
  -> fight_aggressive

=== fight_defensive

You weather the courier's attacks, absorb their speed 
advantage, wait for an opening. When it comes, you take it.

Not a dominant victory, but a victory. The crowd cheers.

* [Collect your winnings]
  ~ credits += 80
  ~ chronicle "The Pit"
    Fought in The Pit. Defensive strategy paid off.
  -> END

=== fight_aggressive

You push the offensive, trying to overwhelm the courier 
before their speed becomes decisive. It almost works.

Almost.

* [Accept defeat]
  ~ chronicle "The Pit"
    Fought in The Pit. Aggressive strategy failed.
  -> END
